<h1>NonStop</h1>

Although probably unintentional, NonStop is a biyearly 
(every-other-year) publication. Subscription rates are $20
dollars for four issues, which should just about get you to
the year 2005. Write to:
<pre>
	NonStop Magazine
	POB 981
	Peck Slip Station, New York NY 10272-0981
</pre>
<p>
All kidding aside, they do have a strange, extremely colorful
<a href="http://www.geocities.com/Area51/Corridor/7174/">webpage</a>
at Geocites. Be sure to visit "Legends of Science Fiction".
